  "solution": {
    "idea": "<p><code>dp[i][j] = min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1]) + a[i][j]</code>，起点 <code>dp[0][0] = a[0][0]</code>。</p><p>第一行只能从左边过来、第一列只能从上面过来，这两条边要么单独写，要么把越界的位置当成一个极大数（<code>10**15</code>）自然绕过。</p><p>行列都不超过 8 时，可以枚举每一种向右向下的顺序核对一遍。只有一行、只有一列这两种数据一定要跑，最容易暴露下标错一格。</p>",
    "code": "\"\"\"p64 方格取数：n 行 m 列的数字表，从左上角走到右下角，只能向右或向下，\n把走过的格子里的数都加起来，求最小的总和。\n网格 DP：dp[i][j] 只可能从上面或左边过来，取两者较小的再加上本格。\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\n\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n, m = int(data[0]), int(data[1])\n    a = [[int(data[2 + i * m + j]) for j in range(m)] for i in range(n)]\n    assert len(data) == 2 + n * m, \"格子里的数个数和 n*m 对不上\"\n\n    big = 10 ** 15\n    dp = [[big] * m for _ in range(n)]\n    dp[0][0] = a[0][0]\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(m):\n            if i == 0 and j == 0:\n                continue\n            best = big\n            if i > 0 and dp[i - 1][j] < best:\n                best = dp[i - 1][j]\n            if j > 0 and dp[i][j - 1] < best:\n                best = dp[i][j - 1]\n            dp[i][j] = best + a[i][j]\n\n    if n <= 8 and m <= 8:         # 小格子直接枚举所有走法核对（只有向右/向下，走法不多）\n        brute = []\n        for mask in range(1 << (n + m - 2)):\n            bits = bin(mask).count(\"1\")\n            if bits != n - 1:     # 1 表示向下，必须正好向下 n-1 次\n                continue\n            seq = [(0, 0)]\n            i = j = 0\n            ok = True\n            for b in range(n + m - 2):\n                if mask >> b & 1:\n                    i += 1\n                else:\n                    j += 1\n                if i >= n or j >= m:\n                    ok = False\n                    break\n                seq.append((i, j))\n            if ok:\n                brute.append(sum(a[x][y] for x, y in seq))\n        assert dp[n - 1][m - 1] == min(brute), \"递推与枚举走法不一致\"\n\n    print(dp[n - 1][m - 1])\n\n\nmain()\n",
    "output": "$ python p64_grid_min_path.py\n输入：3 3\n1 3 1\n1 5 1\n4 2 1\n\n输出：7\r\n",
    "reference": "code/ch07-dp/15_grid_paths.py"
  }
}